 and title/author artwork visually reviewed; not only HTTP200"}]}},{"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","ref":"description:512","key":{"work_id":924100512,"language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":924100512,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":924300302,"text":"Een kus verandert de vriendschap tussen Nick en Charlie. Charlie vreest dat hij te ver is gegaan, terwijl Nick nog probeert te begrijpen wat hij zelf voelt en wat hij met anderen wil delen. In dit tweede deel van de beeldromanreeks ontwikkelen hun verhouding en hun contacten met vrienden en familie zich verder. Het verhaal volgt hoe zij omgaan met verliefdheid, onzekerheid en de reacties van mensen om hen heen.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bureau ISBN; oorspronkelijke gecontroleerde samenvatting","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1555814/heartstopper-deel-2.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T11:04:00Z","review_batch":"nl005-03-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1555814/heartstopper-deel-2.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Source content actually read; original Dutch synopsis, identity reviewed separately","sha256":"eb441ee61c022c1c69dc16eac8bd612a05b7dc4666a9d05411b22ebd367cc764"}]}},{"relation":"editions","ref":"edition:9789032520496","key":{"id":976200123},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":924100553,"title":"Wat de hulp weet","isbn_13":"9789032520496","isbn_10":null,"language":"nld","publisher":"Luitingh-Sijthoff B.V., Uitgeverij","open_library_edition_id":null,"id":976200123}},{"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","ref":"metadata:9789032520496","key":{"edition_id":"@edition:9789032520496"},"before":null,"after":{"edition_id":"@edition:9789032520496","work_id":924100553,"bound_author_id":924300339,"bound_title":"Wat de hulp weet","bound_language":"nld","bound_isbn13":"9789032520496","format":"paperback","cover_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000494651_Wat_de_hulp_weet_0_0.jpg","card_cover_url":null,"evidence_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1818286/wat-de-hulp-weet.html","review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T11:04:00Z","review_batch":"nl005-03-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1818286/wat-de-hulp-weet.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","sha256":"96bb1347bab783807421a612cd8b7d168c5fcf7b17933b07383d8f420e56eed5","fact":"Exact title/author/ISBN, physical format and language source reviewed; independent contradictions recorded"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000494651_Wat_de_hulp_weet_0_0.jpg","checkedAt":"2026-11-01T10:57:02.568Z","sha256":"6e9c9ed61f8174ac2c0e77f32e523a41b6035439253e6eb50f083b89fd82e9b6","bytes":268286,"fact":"Same-edition source association and title/author artwork visually reviewed; not only HTTP200"}]}},{"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","ref":"description:553","key":{"work_id":924100553,"language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":924100553,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":924300339,"text":"Een nieuwe baan bij de familie Garrick lijkt Millie de kans te geven haar verleden op afstand te houden. In het luxe appartement blijft de vrouw des huizes echter achter een gesloten deur. Geluiden en kleine sporen roepen vragen op over wat er werkelijk aan de hand is. Millie wil haar werk niet verliezen, maar kan de signalen niet blijven negeren. Haar poging te helpen brengt ook haar eigen geheimen in gevaar.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bureau ISBN; oorspronkelijke gecontroleerde samenvatting","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1818286/wat-de-hulp-weet.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T11:04:00Z","review_batch":"nl005-03-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1818286/wat-de-hulp-weet.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Source content actually read; original Dutch synopsis, identity reviewed separately","sha256":"96bb1347bab783807421a612cd8b7d168c5fcf7b1793